{
  "name": "Medusa → Order Notifications",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "medusa-events",
        "options": {
          "rawBody": true
        }
      },
      "id": "webhook-trigger",
      "name": "Webhook Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [220, 300],
      "webhookId": "medusa-events"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "order-placed",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.event }}",
              "rightValue": "order.placed",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "or"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "filter-orders",
      "name": "Filter Order Events",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [440, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "event-name",
              "name": "eventName",
              "value": "={{ $json.event }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "order-id",
              "name": "orderId",
              "value": "={{ $json.data?.id ?? 'unknown' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "timestamp",
              "name": "timestamp",
              "value": "={{ $json.timestamp }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "extract-data",
      "name": "Extract Order Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [660, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Order Notifications Workflow\n\nThis workflow receives ALL Medusa events via webhook and filters for order-related events.\n\n### Setup Steps:\n1. **Activate this workflow** (toggle in top-right)\n2. **Copy the webhook URL** from the Webhook Trigger node\n3. **Set it as `N8N_WEBHOOK_URL`** in your Medusa Coolify environment\n4. **Add downstream nodes** — e.g., Send Email (SMTP), Send SMS, Slack notification\n\n### Events handled:\n- `order.placed` — New order created\n- `order.completed` — Order fully paid + fulfilled\n- `order.canceled` — Order was canceled\n\n### Webhook Security:\nThe webhook expects an `X-Webhook-Secret` header matching `N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET`. Add a header check node if you want to enforce this.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "note",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [220, -60]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Filter Order Events",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Filter Order Events": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Extract Order Data",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "medusa"
    }
  ]
}
